Focus Profiles / Saved Filter Presets to focus attention (#refine)

A feature allowing users to create, select, and manage named filter presets ("Focus Profiles" or "Focus Views") to filter down reminders to a specific subset without polluting search queries or tag suggestions. Always includes an default "All / No Profile" option that displays all reminders.

## Proposed Naming & Concept
- **Focus Profiles** (or **Contexts** / **Focus Views**): Saved sets of filter rules (e.g. tag combinations or state filters like `#work`, `#home`, `#today`).
- Selecting a profile narrows the displayed task list to that focus area.
- Selecting "All" / "Default" returns to displaying all tasks.

